#: keycapturedialog.cpp:50
msgid "Enter Key Combination"
msgstr "輸入鑰匙組合"

#: krdc.cpp:133 krdc.cpp:156
msgid "The entered host does not have the required form."
msgstr "輸入的主機沒有所需的表格。"

#: krdc.cpp:134 krdc.cpp:157
msgid "Malformed URL or Host"
msgstr "格式不正確的 URL 或主機"

#: krdc.cpp:163
msgid "%1 - Remote Desktop Connection"
msgstr "%1 - 遠端桌面連線"

#: krdc.cpp:192
msgid ""
"Here you can see the remote desktop. If the other side allows you to control "
"it, you can also move the mouse, click or enter keystrokes. If the content does "
"not fit your screen, click on the toolbar's full screen button or scale button. "
"To end the connection, just close the window."
msgstr ""
"在此你可看到遠端的桌面。如對方容許你控制，你還可以移動滑鼠、單搫或輸入按鍵。如內容不切合你的螢幕，按下工具列的全螢幕按鈕或縮放按鈕。要中斷連線，只需關閉視窗。"

#: krdc.cpp:225
msgid "Establishing connection..."
msgstr "正在建立連線..."

#: krdc.cpp:231
msgid "Authenticating..."
msgstr "正在進行認證..."

#: krdc.cpp:236
msgid "Preparing desktop..."
msgstr "正在準備桌面..."

#: krdc.cpp:383
msgid "View Only"
msgstr "只檢視"

#: krdc.cpp:387
msgid "Always Show Local Cursor"
msgstr "必定顯示本機游標"

#: krdc.cpp:472
msgid "Autohide on/off"
msgstr "自動隱藏開啟/關閉"

#: krdc.cpp:479 krdc.cpp:573 krdc.cpp:575
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全螢幕"

#: krdc.cpp:485 krdc.cpp:487 krdc.cpp:605
msgid "Advanced options"
msgstr "進階選項"

#: krdc.cpp:500 krdc.cpp:584
msgid "Scale view"
msgstr "縮放檢視"

#: krdc.cpp:508
msgid "Minimize"
msgstr "最小化"

#: krdc.cpp:576
msgid ""
"Switches to full screen. If the remote desktop has a different screen "
"resolution, Remote Desktop Connection will automatically switch to the nearest "
"resolution."
msgstr "切換至全螢幕。如遠端桌面有不同的螢幕解像度，遠端桌面連線會自動切換至最接近的解像度。"

#: krdc.cpp:582
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "縮放"

#: krdc.cpp:585
msgid "This option scales the remote screen to fit your window size."
msgstr "此選項將遠端螢幕縮放至切合您的視窗大小。"

#: krdc.cpp:591
msgid "Special Keys"
msgstr "特別鍵"

#: krdc.cpp:593
msgid "Enter special keys."
msgstr "輸入特別鍵。"

#: krdc.cpp:594
msgid ""
"This option allows you to send special key combinations like Ctrl-Alt-Del to "
"the remote host."
msgstr "此選項容許你傳送特別的按鍵組合，例如 Ctrl-Alt-Del 至遠端主機。"

#: krdc.cpp:603
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

#: main.cpp:46
msgid "Remote desktop connection"
msgstr "遠端桌面連線"

#: main.cpp:51
msgid "Start in fullscreen mode"
msgstr "以全螢幕模式開啟"

#: main.cpp:53
msgid "Start in regular window"
msgstr "以一般視窗開啟"

#: main.cpp:55
msgid "Low quality mode (Tight Encoding, 8 bit color)"
msgstr "低質素模式（緊緻編碼， 8 位元顏色）"

#: main.cpp:57
msgid "Medium quality mode (Tight Encoding, lossy)"
msgstr "中等質素模式（緊緻編碼，有損性）"

#: main.cpp:59
msgid "High quality mode, default (Hextile Encoding)"
msgstr "高質素模式，預設（Hextile 編碼）"

#: main.cpp:61
msgid "Start VNC in scaled mode"
msgstr "在縮放模式啟動 VNC"

#: main.cpp:63
msgid "Show local cursor (VNC only)"
msgstr "顯示本機游標（只用於 VNC）"

#: main.cpp:65
msgid "Override VNC encoding list (e.g. 'hextile raw')"
msgstr "蓋過 VNC 編碼清單（例如『hextile raw』）"

#: main.cpp:67
msgid "Provide the password in a file"
msgstr "以檔案形式提供密碼"

#: main.cpp:68
msgid "The name of the host, e.g. 'localhost:1'"
msgstr "主機的名稱，例如『localhost:1』"

#: main.cpp:75 maindialog.cpp:29
msgid "Remote Desktop Connection"
msgstr "遠端桌面連線"

#: main.cpp:86
msgid "RDP backend"
msgstr "RDP 後端"

#: main.cpp:88
msgid "Original VNC viewer and protocol design"
msgstr "原有 VNC 檢視器及協定設計"

#: main.cpp:90
msgid "TightVNC encoding"
msgstr "TightVNC 編碼"

#: main.cpp:92
msgid "ZLib encoding"
msgstr "ZLib 編碼"

#: main.cpp:136
msgid "The password file '%1' does not exist."
msgstr "密碼檔案『%1』不存在。"

#: main.cpp:150
msgid "Wrong geometry format, must be widthXheight"
msgstr "錯誤幾何格式，必須是「寬度X高度」"

#: maindialog.cpp:30
msgid "&Preferences"
msgstr "偏好設定(&P)"

#: maindialog.cpp:36
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "連接"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:45
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:52
msgid "Shared Desktop"
msgstr "分享的桌面"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:55
msgid "Standalone Desktop"
msgstr "獨立的桌面"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:196 maindialogwidget.cpp:357
msgid "default"
msgstr "預設"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:261
msgid ""
"Browsing the network is not possible. You probably did not install SLP support "
"correctly."
msgstr "無法瀏覽網絡。你可能未有正確地安裝 SLP 支援。"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:263
msgid "Browsing Not Possible"
msgstr "無法瀏覽網絡"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:280
msgid "An error occurred while scanning the network."
msgstr "掃描網絡時發生錯誤。"

#: maindialogwidget.cpp:281
msgid "Error While Scanning"
msgstr "掃描時發生錯誤"

#: preferencesdialog.cpp:32
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "偏好設定"

#: preferencesdialog.cpp:38
msgid "&Host Profiles"
msgstr "主機資料檔(&H)"

#: preferencesdialog.cpp:41
msgid "&VNC Defaults"
msgstr "&VNC 預設值"

#: preferencesdialog.cpp:46 preferencesdialog.cpp:54
msgid "Do not &show the preferences dialog on new connections"
msgstr "新的連線不要顯示偏好設定對話盒(&S)"

#: preferencesdialog.cpp:49
msgid "RD&P Defaults"
msgstr "RD&P 預設值"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 25
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Host"
msgstr "主機"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 36
#: rc.cpp:6 rc.cpp:77 rc.cpp:92 rc.cpp:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 47
#: rc.cpp:9 rc.cpp:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設置"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 72
#: rc.cpp:12 rc.cpp:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This list shows all hosts that you have visited and a summary of your settings "
"for them. If you want to reset the setting for a host, you can delete it using "
"the buttons below. When you connect again you can then re-configure them."
msgstr "此清單列出所有你曾到過的主機，及對它們的設置摘要。如你想重設某一主機的設置，可以以下按鈕將它刪除。當再連接時即可重新設定它們。"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 97
#: rc.cpp:15 rc.cpp:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Remove Selected Host"
msgstr "移除選取的主機(&R)"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 100
#: rc.cpp:18 rc.cpp:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deletes the hosts that you have selected in the list above."
msgstr "移除在以上清單中選取的主機。"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 108
#: rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove &All Hosts"
msgstr "移除所有主機(&A)"

#. i18n: file hostprofiles.ui line 111
#: rc.cpp:24 rc.cpp:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes all hosts from the list."
msgstr "移除清單中的所有主機。"

#. i18n: file keycapturewidget.ui line 27
#: rc.cpp:27 rc.cpp:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a special key or key combination to send to the remote side:"
msgstr "輸入要傳送至對方的特別鍵或按鍵組合:"

#. i18n: file keycapturewidget.ui line 92
#: rc.cpp:31 rc.cpp:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This function allows you to send a key combination like Ctrl+Alt+Del to the "
"remote side. Press Esc to cancel."
msgstr "此功能容許你傳送如 Ctrl+Alt+Del 的按鍵組合至對方。按 Esc 取消。"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 41
#: rc.cpp:34 rc.cpp:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remote &desktop:"
msgstr "遠端桌面(&D):"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 64
#: rc.cpp:37 rc.cpp:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter the hostname and display number"
msgstr "輸入主機名稱及顯示數字"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 68
#: rc.cpp:40 rc.cpp:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name and display number of the computer that you want to connect to, "
"separated by a colon, e.g. 'mycomputer:1'. The address can be any valid "
"Internet address. The display numbers usually start at 0. If you do not have a "
"display number, try 0 or 1.\n"
"Remote Desktop Connection only supports systems that use VNC."
msgstr ""
"輸入要連接的電腦的名稱及顯示數字，以冒號分隔，例如『mycomputer:1』。讓位址可以是任何有效的互聯網位址。顯示數字通常從 0 "
"開始。如你沒有顯示數字，嘗試 0 或 1 。\n"
"遠端桌面連線只支援使用 VNC 的系統。"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 84
#: rc.cpp:44 rc.cpp:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Browse <<"
msgstr "瀏覽(&B) <<"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 87
#: rc.cpp:47 rc.cpp:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Turn on/off the network browsing panel."
msgstr "開關網絡瀏覽面板。"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 103
#: rc.cpp:50 rc.cpp:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the address of the computer to connect to, or browse the network and "
"select one. VNC and RDP compatible servers will be supported. <a "
"href=\"whatsthis:"
"<h3>Examples</h3>for a computer called 'megan':"
"<p>"
"<table>"
"<tr>"
"<td>megan:1</td>"
"<td>connect to the VNC server on 'megan' with display number 1</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td>vnc:/megan:1</td>"
"<td>longer form for the same thing</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td>rdp:/megan</td>"
"<td>connect to the RDP server on 'megan'</td></tr></table>\">Examples</a>"
msgstr ""
"輸入要連接的電腦位址，或瀏覽網絡然後選擇一個。 支援 VNC 及 RDP 相容伺服器。 <a href=\"whatsthis:"
"<h3>範例</h3>如電腦稱為『megan』:"
"<p>"
"<table>"
"<tr>"
"<td>megan:1</td>"
"<td>以顯示數字 1 連接『megan』的 VNC 伺服器</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td>vnc:/megan:1</td>"
"<td>同一事情的較長方式</td></tr>"
"<tr>"
"<td>rdp:/megan</td>"
"<td>連接『megan』的 RDP 伺服器</td></tr></table>\">範例</a>"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 136
#: rc.cpp:53 rc.cpp:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Rescan"
msgstr "重新掃描(&R)"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 139
#: rc.cpp:56 rc.cpp:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rescans the network. Depending on the network configuration this may take a few "
"seconds until all systems have responded."
msgstr "重新掃描網絡。視乎你的網絡設定，這可花上幾秒鐘，直至所有系統回應。"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 164
#: rc.cpp:59 rc.cpp:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Search:"
msgstr "搜尋(&S):"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 175
#: rc.cpp:62 rc.cpp:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a search term"
msgstr "輸入搜尋項目"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 178
#: rc.cpp:65 rc.cpp:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter a search term here if you want to search for a specific system, then "
"press Enter or click Rescan. All systems, whose description matches the search "
"term, will be displayed. The search is not case sensitive. If you leave the "
"field empty all systems will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"如要搜尋特定系統，在此輸入搜尋項目然後按「Enter」或單擊「重新掃描」。所有說明符合搜尋項目的系統都會顯示出來。此搜尋不分辨大小寫。如留空此欄則會顯示所有系統"
"。"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 211
#: rc.cpp:68 rc.cpp:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scop&e:"
msgstr "範圍(&E):"

#. i18n: file maindialogbase.ui line 236
#: rc.cpp:71 rc.cpp:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An administrator can configure the network to have several scopes. If this is "
"the case, you can select the scope to scan here."
msgstr "管理員可設定網絡有若干範圍。你可在此選擇要掃描的範圍。"

